<title>HONG KONG: SEA Holdings 1996 net rises 25.4 percent.</title>
<headline>SEA Holdings 1996 net rises 25.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   77.0     vs  62.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0     vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  118.95 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    419.78   vs  334.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,103.87 vs  737.25</p>
<p>    Company name		 SEA Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 11-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 21</p>
<p>NOTE - SEA Holdings engages in securities and property investment and development.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 14 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
